DATASET TERMS
=============
This project downloads datasets at run time; it does NOT redistribute
them (the data/ directory is gitignored). Each dataset remains under the
terms of its original source.

Datasets are obtained from the KEEL dataset repository
(https://sci2s.ugr.es/keel/datasets.php), except EEG Eye State, which is
obtained from the UCI Machine Learning Repository
(https://archive.ics.uci.edu/).

KEEL requests that publications using its datasets cite:

    J. Alcala-Fdez, A. Fernandez, J. Luengo, J. Derrac, S. Garcia,
    L. Sanchez, F. Herrera. "KEEL Data-Mining Software Tool: Data Set
    Repository, Integration of Algorithms and Experimental Analysis
    Framework." Journal of Multiple-Valued Logic and Soft Computing
    17:2-3 (2011) 255-287.
